Provider change guard (Director, 2026-11-09): a started thread keeps its provider unless the user picks
another. The composer no longer falls back to the first ready provider for an existing thread, and a
turn that changes a thread's driver needs message.dispatch's providerChangeApproved. Mobile's
ThreadRouteScreen.tsx line for it lives in 0013-one-picker, which owns that path whole.

